# AI Rules

- Generate production-ready code
- Prefer reusable abstractions
- Use strict TypeScript
- Avoid placeholders
- Avoid mock implementations unless requested
- Keep files small and modular
- Use `@my-bahrain/types` and `@my-bahrain/validators` as shared source of truth
- Ignore nested `node_modules` — only the monorepo layout matters
